WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
Load one bead onto the hook. Lift a new loop.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.600
Slide the bead down onto the loop, above the cloth.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.500
Pull through the previous loop to secure the bead.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Repeat for a row of five beads.
